#belindacarlisle #heavenisaplaceonearth #90spop 

The official YouTube channel for the chart-topping, grammy nominated American singer Belinda Carlisle. Belinda's hits include 'Heaven Is A Place On Earth', 'Circle In The Sand', '(We Want) The Same Thing', 'Live Your Life', and 'Summer Rain'.

